<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27728" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διψ-ᾰλέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thirsty,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Jov.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.128
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.116
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. θρυαλλίδιον</span>”
				<i>wanting oil,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Tim.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύνη δ.</span> the pain <i>of
				thirst,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Dips.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανα δ.</span>”
				<i>subject to thirst,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dry, parched,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
				</span></i>
			 R.<i><span class="en">
				4.678
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				22.260
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>thirst-provoking,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χοῖρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.487
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>).</div>
